OL,3,GNEWSAWork begins on #1.1m town centre
OL,4,Aimprovement plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first phase of building works in a
OL,7,F#1.1m plan to improve Morley town
OL,8,Fcentre is due to begin on Friday.
OL,10,FThe six-month project includes new
OL,11,Fseating and planting, better
OL,12,Faccessibility and other elements to
OL,13,Fboost footfall in the south Leeds
OL,14,Fmarket town.
OL,16,FThe government-funded Morley Town Deal,
OL,17,Fbacked by Leeds City Council, will
OL,18,Finitially be improving the
OL,19,Fpedestrianised area of Queen Street and
OL,20,Fnearby Commercial Street.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
