OL,3,GNEWSAWork begins on #1.1m town centre
OL,4,Aimprovement plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FJames Lewis, leader of the city
OL,7,Fcouncil, said the start of the work,
OL,8,Fafter years of planning and public
OL,9,Fconsultation, would create "an improved
OL,10,Ftown centre experience for all"
